{"4676120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vestalborne", "steam_appid": 4676120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the Wildlands,</i><br><i>Brave the caves below, </i><br><i>Conquer the dungeons deep, </i><br><i>And prove what it means to be…VESTALBORNE</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, Vestalborne!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vestalborne is a co-op action-RPG sandbox of fast combat, deep dungeons, and endless crafting across many dimensions. Keep the Eternal Flame burning in a solo adventure, with friends, or against them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And build your own! Nothing in the world is fixed, it’s your unlimited sandbox. There’s hundred of resources to collect and thousands of items to craft in this unlimited pixel adventure. Dig through mountains, tear down enemy strongholds and traverse the many dimensions to build the world you want to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/496733e122e21128f764cb296bcda0d2.poster.avif?t=1786530627\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/496733e122e21128f764cb296bcda0d2.webm?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/496733e122e21128f764cb296bcda0d2.mp4?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight like the light depends on it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read your enemies, slip through their attacks, and make them pay. Fast paced combat and unique enemies will keep you guessing across an endless sprawling world, and multiple dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/91ddb053620e7ac777c221705f086b08.poster.avif?t=1786530627\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/91ddb053620e7ac777c221705f086b08.webm?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/91ddb053620e7ac777c221705f086b08.mp4?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live a little</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fighting is done, there’s a fire, a field, a furnace and full pot. Grow things. Cook things. Build things. Tend your flock. Make a home that’s worth fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/b309c674f90193e6c60a8d79b8f2f3de.poster.avif?t=1786530627\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/b309c674f90193e6c60a8d79b8f2f3de.webm?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/b309c674f90193e6c60a8d79b8f2f3de.mp4?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring friends (or foes)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your world to friends to take on the evil of the Wildlands in a coop adventure. Or enable PvP and see which of you has what it takes to be the true power in these lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/453ff414ad51564e38231a0ba8063b6b.poster.avif?t=1786530627\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/453ff414ad51564e38231a0ba8063b6b.webm?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/453ff414ad51564e38231a0ba8063b6b.mp4?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world in progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vestalborne is still in the forge right now, built by a small team with big plans. It’s not here yet, but it’s coming, and every Wishlist helps us get to where we’re going. The flame is only just catching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, fall and rise to fight again, Vestalborne</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the Wildlands,</i><br><i>Brave the caves below, </i><br><i>Conquer the dungeons deep, </i><br><i>And prove what it means to be…VESTALBORNE</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, Vestalborne!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vestalborne is a co-op action-RPG sandbox of fast combat, deep dungeons, and endless crafting across many dimensions. Keep the Eternal Flame burning in a solo adventure, with friends, or against them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break the world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And build your own! Nothing in the world is fixed, it’s your unlimited sandbox. There’s hundred of resources to collect and thousands of items to craft in this unlimited pixel adventure. Dig through mountains, tear down enemy strongholds and traverse the many dimensions to build the world you want to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/496733e122e21128f764cb296bcda0d2.poster.avif?t=1786530627\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/496733e122e21128f764cb296bcda0d2.webm?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/496733e122e21128f764cb296bcda0d2.mp4?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight like the light depends on it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read your enemies, slip through their attacks, and make them pay. Fast paced combat and unique enemies will keep you guessing across an endless sprawling world, and multiple dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/91ddb053620e7ac777c221705f086b08.poster.avif?t=1786530627\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/91ddb053620e7ac777c221705f086b08.webm?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/91ddb053620e7ac777c221705f086b08.mp4?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live a little</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fighting is done, there’s a fire, a field, a furnace and full pot. Grow things. Cook things. Build things. Tend your flock. Make a home that’s worth fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/b309c674f90193e6c60a8d79b8f2f3de.poster.avif?t=1786530627\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/b309c674f90193e6c60a8d79b8f2f3de.webm?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/b309c674f90193e6c60a8d79b8f2f3de.mp4?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring friends (or foes)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your world to friends to take on the evil of the Wildlands in a coop adventure. Or enable PvP and see which of you has what it takes to be the true power in these lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/453ff414ad51564e38231a0ba8063b6b.poster.avif?t=1786530627\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/453ff414ad51564e38231a0ba8063b6b.webm?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/extras/453ff414ad51564e38231a0ba8063b6b.mp4?t=1786530627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world in progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vestalborne is still in the forge right now, built by a small team with big plans. It’s not here yet, but it’s coming, and every Wishlist helps us get to where we’re going. The flame is only just catching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, fall and rise to fight again, Vestalborne</p>", "short_description": "Break the world, then build your own. Vestalborne is a co-op action-RPG sandbox of fast combat, deep dungeons, and endless crafting across many dimensions. Keep the Eternal Flame burning in a solo adventure, with friends, or against them.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/fd3dcc513b1f4f8325ac0229f364441202ae5ba9/header.jpg?t=1786530627", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4676120/1de9a